{"text":"kuruntokai","n":128,"lines":["குணகடல் திரையது பறைதபு நாரை","திண்டேர்ப் பொறையன் தொண்டி முன்றுறை","அயிரை ஆரிரைக் கணவந் தாங்குச்","சேயல் அரியோட் படர்தி","நோயை நெஞ்சே நோய்ப்பா லோயே"],"tr":["kuṇakaṭal tiraiyatu paṟaitapu nārai","tiṇṭērp poṟaiyaṉ toṇṭi muṉṟuṟai","ayirai āriraik kaṇavan tāṅkuc","cēyal ariyōṭ paṭarti","nōyai neñcē nōyppā lōyē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"neytal","tinai_ta":"நெய்தல்","speaker_ta":"தலைவன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"பரணர்","speaker_en":"the hero (talaivaṉ)","poet_tr":"Paraṇar"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 19"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 14, veṇṭaḷai 4"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"குணகடல்","tr":"kuṇakaṭal","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குண","tr":"kuṇa"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடல்","tr":"kaṭal"}]},{"text":"திரையது","tr":"tiraiyatu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"திரை","tr":"tirai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யது","tr":"yatu"}]},{"text":"பறைதபு","tr":"paṟaitapu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பறை","tr":"paṟai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தபு","tr":"tapu"}]},{"text":"நாரை","tr":"nārai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரை","tr":"rai"}]}],[{"text":"திண்டேர்ப்","tr":"tiṇṭērp","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"திண்","tr":"tiṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டேர்ப்","tr":"ṭērp"}]},{"text":"பொறையன்","tr":"poṟaiyaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பொறை","tr":"poṟai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யன்","tr":"yaṉ"}]},{"text":"தொண்டி","tr":"toṇṭi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தொண்","tr":"toṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டி","tr":"ṭi"}]},{"text":"முன்றுறை","tr":"muṉṟuṟai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முன்","tr":"muṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுறை","tr":"ṟuṟai"}]}],[{"text":"அயிரை","tr":"ayirai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அயி","tr":"ayi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரை","tr":"rai"}]},{"text":"ஆரிரைக்","tr":"āriraik","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆ","tr":"ā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ரிரைக்","tr":"riraik"}]},{"text":"கணவந்","tr":"kaṇavan","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கண","tr":"kaṇa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வந்","tr":"van"}]},{"text":"தாங்குச்","tr":"tāṅkuc","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தாங்","tr":"tāṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"குச்","tr":"kuc"}]}],[{"text":"சேயல்","tr":"cēyal","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சே","tr":"cē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யல்","tr":"yal"}]},{"text":"அரியோட்","tr":"ariyōṭ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அரி","tr":"ari"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யோட்","tr":"yōṭ"}]},{"text":"படர்தி","tr":"paṭarti","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"படர்","tr":"paṭar"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தி","tr":"ti"}]}],[{"text":"நோயை","tr":"nōyai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நோ","tr":"nō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யை","tr":"yai"}]},{"text":"நெஞ்சே","tr":"neñcē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நெஞ்","tr":"neñ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சே","tr":"cē"}]},{"text":"நோய்ப்பா","tr":"nōyppā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நோய்ப்","tr":"nōyp"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பா","tr":"pā"}]},{"text":"லோயே","tr":"lōyē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லோ","tr":"lō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"குணகடல்","parts":[{"text":"குண","lemma":"குணக்கு","gloss":"eastern"},{"text":"கடல்","lemma":"கடல்","gloss":"sea"}],"gloss":"eastern sea"},{"surface":"திரையது","parts":[{"text":"திரை","lemma":"திரை","gloss":"wave"},{"text":"அது","lemma":"அது","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the waves"},{"surface":"பறைதபு","parts":[{"text":"பறை","lemma":"பறை","gloss":"flight"},{"text":"தபு","lemma":"தபு","gloss":"lose/perish"}],"gloss":"having lost the strength of flight"},{"surface":"நாரை","parts":[{"text":"நாரை","lemma":"நாரை","gloss":"heron"}],"gloss":"heron"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"திண்டேர்","parts":[{"text":"திண்","lemma":"திண்மை","gloss":"strong"},{"text":"தேர்","lemma":"தேர்","gloss":"chariot"}],"gloss":"strong chariot"},{"surface":"பொறையன்","parts":[{"text":"பொறையன்","lemma":"பொறையன்","gloss":"Poraiyan (Chera king)"}],"gloss":"Poraiyan"},{"surface":"தொண்டி","parts":[{"text":"தொண்டி","lemma":"தொண்டி","gloss":"Tondi (port city)"}],"gloss":"Tondi"},{"surface":"முன்றுறை","parts":[{"text":"முன்","lemma":"முன்","gloss":"front"},{"text":"துறை","lemma":"துறை","gloss":"shore/harbor"}],"gloss":"front shore"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அயிரை","parts":[{"text":"அயிரை","lemma":"அயிரை","gloss":"ayirai (a kind of small fish)"}],"gloss":"ayirai fish"},{"surface":"ஆரிரைக்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ஆர்","gloss":"abundant"},{"text":"இரை","lemma":"இரை","gloss":"food"},{"text":"க்கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"for"}],"gloss":"for the abundant food"},{"surface":"அணவந்து","parts":[{"text":"அணவந்து","lemma":"அணவு","gloss":"having approached"}],"gloss":"having approached"},{"surface":"ஆங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"ஆங்கு","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சேயல்","parts":[{"text":"சேயல்","lemma":"சேயள்","gloss":"she who is far away"}],"gloss":"she who is far away"},{"surface":"அரியோள்","parts":[{"text":"அரி","lemma":"அரி","gloss":"rare/difficult"},{"text":"ஓள்","lemma":"ஓள்","gloss":"she"}],"gloss":"she who is difficult to attain"},{"surface":"படர்தி","parts":[{"text":"படர்","lemma":"படர்","gloss":"think of"},{"text":"தி","lemma":"தி","gloss":"you"}],"gloss":"you think of"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நோயை","parts":[{"text":"நோய்","lemma":"நோய்","gloss":"pain"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"you have"}],"gloss":"you have pain"},{"surface":"நெஞ்சே","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சு","lemma":"நெஞ்சு","gloss":"heart"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"O"}],"gloss":"O heart"},{"surface":"நோய்ப்பாலோயே","parts":[{"text":"நோய்","lemma":"நோய்","gloss":"pain"},{"text":"பால்","lemma":"பால்","gloss":"nature/portion"},{"text":"ஓய்","lemma":"ஓய்","gloss":"you who have"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"you who are of the nature of pain indeed"}]}],"literal":"Eastern sea wave's flight-lost heron / strong-charioted Poṟaiyaṉ's Toṇṭi front-shore / ayirai fish abundant food to approach like / she who is far away, difficult to attain, you think of / you have pain, O heart, you who are of the nature of pain!","translation":"O heart, like the heron that has lost its strength of flight in the waves of the eastern sea and approaches the front shore of Tondi, belonging to Poraiyan of the strong chariot, to feed on the abundant ayirai fish, you think of her who is far away and difficult to attain. You are in pain, O heart, you whose very nature is pain!","modern":"கிழக்குக் கடலின் அலைகளால் பறக்கும் திறனை இழந்த நாரையானது, வலிமையான தேரை உடைய பொறையனது தொண்டித் துறையில் உள்ள அயிரை மீனாகிய சிறந்த இரையை நாடிச் செல்வது போல, தொலைவில் உள்ளவளும் அடைவதற்கு அரியவளுமாகிய தலைவியைப் பற்றி நீ நினைக்கின்றாய். நெஞ்சமே! நீ துன்பப்படுகிறாய்; துன்பத்தையே இயல்பாகக் கொண்டவன் நீ!","explanation":"In this poem, the hero speaks to his own heart, expressing his deep longing and helplessness. He has fallen in love with the heroine, who is physically distant and difficult to reach. He compares his heart's yearning to a weak, flight-weary heron that has lost its strength in the rough waves of the eastern sea and can only crawl or struggle toward the shore of Tondi to feed on the small ayirai fish. This imagery belongs to the Neytal (coastal) landscape, which traditionally represents the theme of longing, anxiety, and despair (iraṅkal). The key words are 'குணகடல்' (eastern sea), 'நாரை' (heron), 'தொண்டி' (Tondi), and 'நோய்' (pain/sickness).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.8],[1.8,1.9],[1.9,3.0],[3.0,3.3],[3.3,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.9,4.1],[4.1,4.16],[4.16,4.16],[4.16,4.16],[4.16,4.23],[4.29,4.35],[4.35,4.8],[4.8,8.6],[8.6,8.93],[9.0,9.44],[9.44,9.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.0],[1.0,1.8],[1.8,2.0],[2.0,2.0],[2.0,3.3],[3.3,3.4],[3.4,4.0],[4.0,4.0],[4.0,4.58],[4.58,6.1],[6.1,6.63],[6.77,7.03],[7.03,7.03],[7.03,8.0],[8.0,8.68],[8.68,8.9],[8.9,10.0],[10.0,10.3]]}}